}Bonds list/bondsThis API call returns an array of bonds available at Twelve Data API. This list is updated daily.API credits cost1per requestParametersResponseSign in to querysymbolstringThe ticker symbol of an instrument for which data is requestedExample:US2YexchangestringFilter by exchange nameExample:NYSEcountrystringFilter by country name or alpha code, e.g.,United StatesorUSExample:United StatesformatstringThe format of the response dataSupports:JSON,CSVDefault:JSONdelimiterstringThe separator used in the CSV response dataDefault:;show_planbooleanAdds info on which plan symbol is availableDefault:falsepageintegerPage number of the results to fetchDefault:1outputsizeintegerDetermines the number of data points returned in the outputDefault:5000Request examplehttps://api.twelvedata.com/bonds?apikey=demo&source=docsResponse{
